 of item that needs to registered can be sub-classed;\nL47: —    Clause 7 specifies the metamodel for Identification of registry items;\nL48: \nL49: —    Clause 8 specifies the metamodel for Designation and Definition of registry items;\nL50: \nL51: —    Clause 9 specifies the metamodel for Registration of registry items;\nL52: \nL53: —    Clause 10 specifies the metamodel for Classification of registry items;\nL54: \nL55: —    Clause 11 specifies the metamodel for Mapping among registry items.\nL56: ### Buy together\nL57: \nL58: Package - 10% discount\nL59: \nL60: ##### cite3†AI and information security management package L61: \nL62: Enhance your organization's AI management and information security with this comprehensive standards package.\nL63: \nL64:   * ISO/IEC 42001:2023\nL65:   * ISO/IEC 27001:2022\nL66: \nL67: English | PDF\nL68: \nL69: CHF 380 CHF 340\nL70: ## General information\nL71: \nL72:   * Status\nL73: \nL74:  : Published\nL75: \nL76: Publication date\nL77: \nL78:  : 2023-01\nL79: \nL80: Stage\nL81: \nL82: : International Standard published [cite1†60.60 ]\nL83: \nL84:   * Edition\nL85: \nL86:  : 4\nL87: \nL88: Number of pages\nL89: \nL90:  : 97\nL91: \nL92:   * Technical Committee :\nL93: \nL94: cite4†ISO/IEC JTC 1/SC 32 L95: \nL96: ICS :\nL97: \nL98: cite5†35.040.50 L99: \nL100:   * cite6†RSS updates\nL101: \nL102: ##  Amendments\nL103: \nL104: Amendments are issued when it is found that new material may need to be added to an existing standardization document. They may also include editorial or technical corrections to be applied to the existing document.\nL105: ### cite7†Amendment 1 L106: \nL107: #### Enhancements to Item Mapping\nL108: \nL109: Edition 2026\nL110: \nL111: Language\nL112: \nL113: [Select]\nL114: \nL115: Format\nL116: \nL117: [Input] PDF + ePub\nL118: \nL119: [Input] Paper\nL120: \nL121: CHF (Swiss francs) 159\nL122: \nL123: [Button: Add to cart]\nL124: \nL125: Convert Swiss francs (CHF) to cite8†your currency†w